Error [jet.NeverFunctionReachesEnd]: Function `almost` promises `Never` but can reach the end.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_module_exit.jet:14:10
    |
 14 |     term.print("still here")
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: A declared `Never` return means every path must stop; this path falls through instead.
 Fix: End every path with `panic`, a `Never` call, or another diverging operation, or remove `Never`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2423
